WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.480
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:13.481 --> 00:00:17.161
I'm a parrot.

3
00:00:17.162 --> 00:00:21.618
Parrots are a type of bird.

4
00:00:21.619 --> 00:00:24.405
Where do you live?

5
00:00:24.406 --> 00:00:29.204
Parrots live all over the world.

6
00:00:29.205 --> 00:00:35.540
Most parrots like warm places like rain forests.

7
00:00:35.541 --> 00:00:40.117
But some live in snowy places.

8
00:00:40.118 --> 00:00:43.551
What do you eat?

9
00:00:43.552 --> 00:00:48.246
Parrots mostly eat nuts and seeds.

10
00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:54.545
Our beaks are sharp.

11
00:00:54.546 --> 00:01:00.212
We use them to crack open nuts and seeds.

12
00:01:00.213 --> 00:01:03.720
Do all parrots look the same?

13
00:01:03.721 --> 00:01:09.842
No. There are many different kinds of parrots.

14
00:01:09.843 --> 00:01:14.714
But we all have curved beaks.

15
00:01:14.715 --> 00:01:21.040
And we all have four toes!

16
00:01:21.041 --> 00:01:24.780
Can parrots really learn words?

17
00:01:24.781 --> 00:01:30.526
Yep. Parrots are very smart birds.

18
00:01:30.527 --> 00:01:35.574
Some parrots can learn words from people.

19
00:01:35.575 --> 00:01:40.753
We can imitate other sounds too.

20
00:01:40.754 --> 00:01:43.849
Do you live alone?

21
00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:48.700
Parrots live in groups called flocks.

22
00:01:48.701 --> 00:01:52.994
We like to talk to each other.

23
00:01:52.995 --> 00:01:57.470
We scream and squawk!

24
00:01:57.471 --> 00:02:01.720
Do you have any enemies?

25
00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:06.211
People are our main enemy.

26
00:02:06.212 --> 00:02:14.394
They often take us for pets.

27
00:02:14.395 --> 00:02:21.545
I see my flock. Good-bye!

28
00:02:21.546 --> 00:02:28.452
Good-bye, Parrot!

